# Relations this migration declares; probed by db-schema/tests/schema_fence.rs.
#
# No `rows` directive on either table, and that is the whole point of the shape
# this migration chose: the rows are written by a collector at bring-up, not by
# the migration, so a count here would assert against an empty table on a fresh
# database and fail. What pins the content instead is
# `market-data/tests/parked_mirror.rs`, which runs the real write against a
# container and asserts the mirrored set matches `PARKED_SOURCES`.
table parked_sources
table parked_source_feeds
